OL,3,AWorld's first patient to undergo live
OL,4,AAI-assisted brain surgery has tumour
OL,5,Aremoved
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe world's first patient to have brain
OL,8,Fsurgery with live artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence assistance has
OL,10,Fsuccessfully had his tumour removed.
OL,12,FRhys Hibbert, a father-of-two from
OL,13,FBedfordshire, could have lost his sight
OL,14,Fwithout the operation, said surgeons at
OL,15,FUniversity College London Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30702
